        <activityName xml:lang="en">Chipper, stationary, electric</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Chipper, stationary, electric
Chipper with an houerly output of 3.3 m3/h bulked chips and a life time output of 100'000 m3 (=1.886E7 kg dried matter) bulked chips. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for chopping industrial residue wood if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: Häckseler; 
UUID: 27407c4a-b0d4-306d-b3ac-7313687d7509
The material (production and disposal) and their transports needed for a stationary chipper in a sawmill. Land used is not included as it is already included in the sawmill.
Location: Estimate is so rough that the Geograhpy is not relevant.
Technology: Stationary electric chipper
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_27407c4a-b0d4-306d-b3ac-7313687d7509.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
